        "original_id": "8197cfe2-1bd0-5eff-8bc6-0bafe1074396",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Kinky, Reina, Atlas, SSX 3, Man on Fire\n- People: Tony Scott, Brian Helgeland, A. J. Quinnell\n- Topics: songs, albums, films, video games, language use\n\nFacts:\n- In 2002, Kinky released the album Kinky.\n- In 2003, Kinky released the album Atlas.\n- The song \"Más\" by Kinky is featured in the PS2 video game SSX 3.\n- In 2004, the song \"Más\" by Kinky is featured in the film Man on Fire.\n- Man on Fire is a 2004 British-American crime thriller film directed by Tony Scott.\n- Man on Fire was written by Brian Helgeland and is based on A. J. Quinnell's 1980 novel of the same name.\n- Reina has lyrics sung more in English than Spanish, unlike Kinky's two preceding albums Kinky and Atlas.",
